# Event logs are run OUTPUT, not source. Tracking one meant every manual run of
# a solution showed up as a modification and added noise to every git status.
# The rule covers *.log rather than one filename because the default log name is
# derived from the executable: a binary built from solutions/ch03 writes
# ch03.log, and one you named yourself writes whatever you named it.
*.log
